  m_text: "Played cards go to the discard pile. The number shows how many cards are in it.\nAt the start of each round, 2 cards return from the discard pile to your deck, and cards like Recycle bring back more.\n\n<b>Click the discard pile to look inside, then click it again to close it.</b>"
