  m_text: "These are the cards in your hand. The number in the top left is the AP cost; the text says what the card does.\n\nAttack cards deal damage. Movement cards (like Rotate, Backstab or Sword Swing) change your square.\n\n<b>Play a card now to continue.</b>"
