  m_text: "This is the battlefield. The enemy stands in the center; you stand on one of the four squares around it.\n\n<b>Each round the enemy marks the square(s) it will attack. If you are standing there when your turn ends, you get hit.</b>\n\nMovement cards let you step out of the way. Dodging is the heart of every fight."
