  m_text: "Divine Focus powers <b>Shifting</b>.\nDuring your turn, press <b>Z</b> (or the Shift button) to swap your active deck for another, such as a god's deck.\n\nEach Shift costs 1 DF and can trigger special effects when you enter or leave a deck. DF does not refill on its own, so save it for the right moment."
